    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.poster.avif?t=1696947936\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.webm?t=1696947936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.mp4?t=1696947936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Addictive Idle Gameplay</h2><i>Install Fee Tycoon</i>  is a satirical Idle Clicker -- Click, Click, Click to make money. Spend your money on upgrades to make money faster. The more you make, the faster you'll make more!<br><br>Chaos3D, The popular game engine, has started charging developers each time their games are installed in a bid to increase their stock price. They have also reached out to you, a notorious software pirate. Why? So that they can pay you to re-install those same games, of course!  Scam unwitting developers: get rich, and destroy the video game industry in the process!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames!</h2>In most Idle games, you can purchase &quot;Buildings&quot; to increase your production. In Install Fee Tycoon, that takes the form of &quot;Dark Web Contacts&quot; which will run more reinstalls for you. However, each of these contacts has problems; whether their computer is choked with spyware, or they want you to hack into a bank's website, there's lots to do, and lots of hidden upgrades to unlock!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.poster.avif?t=1696947936\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.webm?t=1696947936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613830/extras/165b8cb8c6541c03d6a5ade9f2971b92.mp4?t=1696947936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Addictive Idle Gameplay</h2><i>Install Fee Tycoon</i>  is a satirical Idle Clicker -- Click, Click, Click to make money. Spend your money on upgrades to make money faster. The more you make, the faster you'll make more!<br><br>Chaos3D, The popular game engine, has started charging developers each time their games are installed in a bid to increase their stock price. They have also reached out to you, a notorious software pirate. Why? So that they can pay you to re-install those same games, of course!  Scam unwitting developers: get rich, and destroy the video game industry in the process!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames!</h2>In most Idle games, you can purchase &quot;Buildings&quot; to increase your production. In Install Fee Tycoon, that takes the form of &quot;Dark Web Contacts&quot; which will run more reinstalls for you. However, each of these contacts has problems; whether their computer is choked with spyware, or they want you to hack into a bank's website, there's lots to do, and lots of hidden upgrades to unlock!",
